ts the King's mobility\n- After the King moves, I can continue applying pressure with my well-placed Queen\n- This maintains maximum initiative and keeps White on the defensive\n\nReason: Q: f2-e2 delivers check while maintaining the Queen's dominant position near White's exposed King. This forces White into a defensive response and allows me to maintain the initiative. The White King's exposed position combined with my Queen's activity gives me excellent winning chances by keeping up the pressure.\n\nAnswer: Q: f2-e2"}
