ion that White must address urgently. With the pawn on d2, White will have to commit significant resources to stop it, and it severely restricts White's piece mobility. This is a classic case where a far-advanced passed pawn becomes the decisive factor. The threat is so strong that it should dictate the flow of the game going forward.\n\nAnswer: P: d3-d2"}
