ite's king moves, I can use the rook to control key files and ranks\n- It allows me to coordinate my king advance with rook support\n- Check moves maintain the initiative and restrict opponent options\n\nThis move follows the principle of using checks to improve piece coordination in winning endgames.\n\nAnswer: R: b2-c2"}
